      "writtenOn": "2024-08-02T00:26:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For now, I think a simple on/off switch is enough, but in the future I think this shall be more complicated. For example, we would enable the USB controller, but would like to pass only certain USB devices to the VM. Then this shall be a list of USB devices. Just FYI.",
