      "writtenOn": "2024-08-02T02:18:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The idea of a list makes sense. Hot-plugging comes to mind though.\n\nWould VMs support hot-plugged devices? Mouse, keyboard, storage, etc.\n\nI thought of disabling USB if the list is empty after you suggested the list, but there\u0027s no guarantee that there won\u0027t be a USB device in the future as a VM is running, unless we specify that hot-plugging is not supported.\n\nMaybe having 2 separate variables would be viable, enable the controller and then the list of devices. WDYT?",
